WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.900
Let your agent work with your whole team. This is Greenhouse.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.900
Connect your own agent to team resources, within your permissions.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.900
Search knowledge, read files and follow answers back to their sources.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:25.900
Analyze tables and move projects forward, with tasks and discussion together.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:36.900
Share skills, create reports from team templates and save them to Files. Schedule recurring work and revisit its results.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:47.900
Continue on the web, iPhone and iPad. Chat, find information and follow progress. A Feishu bot is optional.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:55.900
Scoped access, recorded MCP writes and deletion previews. Paid calls count toward clear budgets.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.900
Open source. Self-hosted. A place for your team to grow.
